# 02_temple_exploration (layers 4 6): Splinters u05d3 u05d1 u05d0 u05cf. Wake them, then let them fight a god-mode player, hurt and kill them.
# Run: BUILD=build-port-cov tools/cov/run.sh tools/cov/specs/splinter.py <out> 3bfa3eff,02_temple_exploration --con <this> --fast --frames 3400
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give morphBall 1; give boostBall 1; fastmorph 1
@f302 layer 4; layer 6
@f305 send u05d3 Activate; send u05d1 Activate; send u05d0 Activate; send u05cf Activate
@f310 tp 215 -205 -50
@f330 send u05d3 Alert; send u05d1 Alert; send u05d0 Alert; send u05cf Alert
@f1200 obj u05d3; obj u05d1; obj u05d0
@f2200 damage u05d3 2; damage u05d1 2; damage u05d0 2; damage u05cf 2
@f2500 damage u05d3 2 kb; damage u05d1 2 kb; damage u05d0 2 kb; damage u05cf 2 kb
@f2800 damage u05d3 20 missile; damage u05d1 20 missile; damage u05d0 20 missile; damage u05cf 20 missile
@f3300 objs Splinter
